[00:41.49]Hands in the fire
{"双手探入烈火"}
[00:44.54]Smoke and ash and broken glass
{"硝烟灰烬与碎玻璃"}
[00:46.62]Are what we're used to
{"才是我们的日常"}
[00:51.82]Hands in the fire
{"双手探入烈火"}
[00:54.84]Tear it down ,we're blacking out
{"摧毁一切 直到意识模糊"}
[00:56.71]Until we burn through
{"直至燃烧殆尽"}
[00:59.36]Me and you
{"你我同在"}
